# What EAS Build uploads from this repository: only the mobile app. Everything else (the API, the site, the
# video renderer and its data) is not part of an Android or iOS build. Replaces .gitignore for EAS, so the
# usual ignores are repeated here.
/*
!/mobile

# Secrets never leave this machine in the archive (EAS reads credentials.json itself)
/mobile/credentials.json
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/.env*

# Dependencies and generated folders
**/node_modules/
/mobile/.expo/
/mobile/dist/
/mobile/web-build/
/mobile/android/
/mobile/ios/
/mobile/.kotlin/
**/.DS_Store
**/*.tsbuildinfo
